id: library
name: Library packages
description: 'A library is code several generators share: the folder <id>/ at the top of its cell, named by
  its id (an underscore name such as _my_helpers, which is also its import name), holding <id>.library and
  the code. Write the code first, then the definition with a name and a description that tells an agent
  what the library offers and how to import it; a generator''s cell names it under shared: in its cell.yaml.'
types:
- ext: .library
guidance: 'A library is code several generators share: the folder <id>/ at the top of its cell, named by
  its id (an underscore name such as _my_helpers, which is also its import name), holding <id>.library and
  the code. Write the code first, then the definition with a name and a description that tells an agent
  what the library offers and how to import it; a generator''s cell names it under shared: in its cell.yaml.'
examples:
- folder: basic
  description: A minimal library at the top of its cell with its code beside its definition.
  expect: valid
  feedback: The declaration names its folder and carries a name and description.
